mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">in English</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">)</span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

                </td>
                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course provides a comprehensive introduction to the development of evidence-based healthcare; the concepts, processes, and significance of evidence-based nursing; the JBI Model of Evidence-Based Healthcare; evidence searching and retrieval; critical appraisal of research literature; systematic reviews; the application of clinical practice guidelines; and the latest best available evidence for nursing practice from both China and abroad. The course covers a wide range of established areas of evidence-based nursing practice, including patient safety management, wound care, catheter care, pain management, diabetes care, women’s health, pediatric nursing, gerontological nursing, and community nursing.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the course, students are expected to understand the fundamental principles and significance of evidence-based nursing, critically appraise the quality of different types of research literature, become familiar with the latest best available evidence relevant to clinical nursing practice, and understand the importance of evidence-informed decision-making in improving nursing practice. Through coursework, case analyses, and project-based assignments, students will also be expected to demonstrate scientific thinking, professionalism, and scientific literacy.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
